  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>There are 2 cases-</p><p>i. All the 4 are girls</p><p>ii. 3 girls and 1 boy</p><p>So the answer is&nbsp;</p><p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>380</mn></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; (<math><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> No. of ways of selecting captain)</p>",
